description: SEO for public storefront pages
alwaysApply: true
---

# SEO

Every public route sets `head()` with a unique `<title>` (≤ 60 chars, ends ` | Booker Flowers & Gifts`) and a meta description (≤ 160). One `<h1>` per page. Images have meaningful `alt` (decorative: `alt=""` / `aria-hidden`).

Not indexed: `/admin`, `/driver`, `/cart`, `/thanks`, `/auth`, `/api`, `/photos` (`robots` noindex in `head()`; add `robots.txt` disallows when that file exists).

